      "text": {
        "jp": "こんなに楽しそうな子供たちを見るのは\r\nいつぶりかしら？",
        "official_en": "Aww, I can’t remember the last time I saw my kids smile that much.",
        "real_en": "When was the last time I saw children having this much fun?"
