      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "兵士としての本質を見失っていたよ。\r\n誰かの命令に従うだけなら\r\n機械で充分だもんな。",
        "official_en": "I’d forgotten what it means to be a soldier... It’s not just about following orders. They might as well use machines if it was.",
