      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "反乱軍の奴らめ、やけくそにでもなったか？\r\nこの兵力差で勝てるわけないだろう。",
        "official_en": "Have those rebels gone mad? We have them outnumbered, outgunned, and outclassed! How could they ever hope to win?",
        "real_en": "Have those rebels gotten desperate? There's no way they can win with such a difference in troop strength."
